      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "因为一封信说：放爵士的家，斧头不会落下。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N1",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "故事要从一年前说起。1918年5月，新奥尔良的杂货店主夫妇。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N2",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "深夜，凶手蹲在后门口，用凿子，一点一点凿开一个方洞。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N2",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "他没有惊动任何人，只留下墙上一个斧头的影子。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N2",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "清晨，弟弟推开门，抽屉里的钱，一分没少。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N2",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "接下来一年多，斧头一次次落在意大利裔杂货店家中。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N3",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "凶手总是从后门进来，用的，常常是主人家自己的斧头。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N3",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "警方疲于奔命，居民把斧头藏进柜子，把门窗钉死。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N3",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "入夜以后，整座城市被恐惧笼罩。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N3",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "1919年3月10日，河对岸的格雷特纳，一家杂货店。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N4",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "店主夫妇被打成重伤，他们两岁的女儿，没能活下来。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N4",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "警方一度把邻居父子当成凶手，两人被判重刑。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N4",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "一年多后，那份关键证词，被指有问题。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N4",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "三月中旬，当地报纸登出了一封奇怪的信。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N5",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "落款：来自地狱。写于1919年3月13日。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N5",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "信里说：下周二午夜十二点十五分，我会经过新奥尔良。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N5",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "如果屋里正放着爵士乐，我会放过这一家。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N5",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "3月19日，圣约瑟夫节前夜，全城行动起来。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N6",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "作曲家达维拉，连夜写出一首《神秘斧头手的爵士》。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N6",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "午夜十二点十五分，整座城的爵士乐，震耳欲聋。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N6",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "那一夜，没有人遇害。全城的乐声，一直响到天亮。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N6",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "可半年后，1919年10月27日，斧头杀手又回来了一次。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N7",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "杂货店主迈克·佩皮托内，在卧室里遇害。这是最后一起。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N7",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "妻子埃丝特，看见一个男人从后门逃出去。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N7",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "之后，斧头杀手再也没出现。案卷被推进档案柜。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N8",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "一年多后，洛杉矶，埃丝特开枪打死一个男人。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N8",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "她说，那个人叫蒙弗尔，就是斧头杀手。可研究者找不到他。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
